{pad:meta title='Silent in a page', about='With $padAssert off, as here, the asserts render nothing - not even the one on a field that does not exist.'/}
{pad:set $total = 42/}
<p>Before the asserts.</p>
{pad:assert $total eq 42, 'the cart total'/}
{pad:assert $missing gt 0, 'never evaluated'/}
<p>After the asserts - nothing between the two paragraphs.</p>
